referenceFunction.generalComment:
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg anhydrous ethanol 99.7% (dry basis, i.e. 1.003 kg anhydrous ethanol 99.7% wet basis). Dehydration is carried out by molecular sieve technology. Ethanol is produced from sweet sorghum, in the average CN context.;
CAS number: 000064-17-5; 
Formula: C2H6O ; 
Synonyms: Alkohol, alcohol dehydrated, algrain, Anhydrol, cologne spirit, cologne spirits (alcohol), Denatured alcohol, Ethyl alcohol, Ethanol, ethanol 200 proof, Ethanol absolute, ethyl hydrate, ethyl hydroxide, fermentation alcohol, grain alcohol, bioethanol, bio-ethanol; 
UUID: 9d3eb68a-305e-3dd8-8ad3-56359164f4b7
